<title>HONG KONG: Trading in China Strategic suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in China Strategic suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Strategic Holdings Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock closed at HK$2.375 on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>China Strategic said last month that its wholly-owned Sifford Ltd would make a cash offer for shares of Tricom Holdings Ltd at HK$1.20 per share after it bought a total 83.06 million shares, or 37 percent of Tricom.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
